Ndiyo, hakuna matatizo.

234
00:12:28,592 --> 00:12:30,592
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

235
00:12:30,615 --> 00:12:33,482
Unaomba nifanyeje na nywele za uso?

236
00:12:33,505 --> 00:12:37,105
Nifanye ziwe hadi pembeni ya nyusi tu.

237
00:12:37,128 --> 00:12:38,928
Nimeelewa.

238
00:12:38,951 --> 00:12:42,685
Kwa kawaida unatumia bidhaa za kutengeneza nywele?

239
00:12:42,708 --> 00:12:46,554
Ndiyo, kila asubuhi ninatumia waks.

240
00:12:46,578 --> 00:12:48,578
Nimeelewa.

241
00:12:48,601 --> 00:12:52,267
Nitakata ili upate urahisi wa kuweka nywele.

242
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:53,973
Asante.

243
00:12:53,997 --> 00:12:55,674
Asante sana, nitasaidia sana.

244
00:12:55,697 --> 00:12:58,752
Leo una likizo ya kazi?

245
00:12:58,776 --> 00:13:02,853
Ndiyo, leo niko likizo ya kazi.

246
00:13:02,876 --> 00:13:05,876
Kwa kawaida hujafanya nini wakati wa likizo?

247
00:13:05,899 --> 00:13:10,187
Ninatembea bustanini au kwenda kafe.

248
00:13:10,211 --> 00:13:11,977
Sawa, ni vizuri.

249
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:15,835
Kuna kafe nzuri karibu na hapa.

250
00:13:15,859 --> 00:13:17,713
Kweli?

251
00:13:17,736 --> 00:13:20,070
Ningependa kwenda siku nyingine.

252
00:13:20,093 --> 00:13:23,946
Sasa, tutaanza na kunawa nywele.

253
00:13:23,970 --> 00:13:27,703
Tafadhali nifuate huko kwa eneo la kunawa nywele.

254
00:13:27,726 --> 00:13:29,859
Sawa, nimeelewa.

255
00:13:29,882 --> 00:13:32,116
Nakutakia kila la heri.

256
00:13:32,139 --> 00:13:33,639
Sehemu ya 7: Kutengeneza Kadi ya Kutumia Maktaba

257
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:35,572
Samahani.

258
00:13:35,595 --> 00:13:38,397
Nimefika hapa kwa mara ya kwanza.

259
00:13:38,421 --> 00:13:39,989
Karibu sana.

260
00:13:40,012 --> 00:13:42,786
Karibu maktabani.

261
00:13:42,809 --> 00:13:47,043
Ningependa kukopa vitabu, lakini sina kadi.

262
00:13:47,066 --> 00:13:49,032
Sawa, nimekuelewa.

263
00:13:49,055 --> 00:13:52,033
Tutengeneze kadi ya matumizi.

264
00:13:52,057 --> 00:13:54,473
Nitengenezeje?

265
00:13:54,496 --> 00:13:59,031
Tafadhali jaza jina lako na anwani kwenye fomu hii.

266
00:13:59,055 --> 00:14:00,889
Nimeelewa.

267
00:14:00,912 --> 00:14:03,209
Nitaandika hapa.

268
00:14:03,232 --> 00:14:05,101
Asante.

269
00:14:05,125 --> 00:14:09,178
Una kitambulisho chochote kinachoonyesha anwani yako?

270
00:14:09,201 --> 00:14:13,001
Ndiyo, nina kadi ya kukaa.

271
00:14:13,024 --> 00:14:14,881
Niruhusu nione.

272
00:14:14,905 --> 00:14:17,556
Ndiyo, nimeithibitisha.

273
00:14:17,579 --> 00:14:20,146
Hapa ni kadi yako.

274
00:14:20,169 --> 00:14:22,183
Asante.

275
00:14:22,206 --> 00:14:25,489
Ninaweza kukopa vitabu vingapi kwa wakati mmoja?

276
00:14:25,513 --> 00:14:28,889
Unaweza kukopa hadi vitabu vitano kwa wakati mmoja.

277
00:14:28,913 --> 00:14:31,846
Muda wa kurudisha ni wa muda gani?

278
00:14:31,869 --> 00:14:35,088
Muda wa kurudisha ni wiki mbili.

279
00:14:35,111 --> 00:14:38,045
Tafadhali rudisha ndani ya wiki mbili.

280
00:14:38,068 --> 00:14:39,901
Nimeelewa.

281
00:14:39,924 --> 00:14:43,742
Kuna mahali pa kusoma kimya?

282
00:14:43,766 --> 00:14:48,582
Ndiyo, kuna eneo la kusoma kimya katika ghorofa ya pili.

283
00:14:48,605 --> 00:14:51,372
Naweza kutumia kompyuta?

284
00:14:51,395 --> 00:14:55,771
Ndiyo, kuna viti ambavyo vinaweza kutumika na kompyuta.

285
00:14:55,795 --> 00:14:58,561
Hiyo itanisaidia sana.

286
00:14:58,584 --> 00:15:01,988
Asante kwa kunieleza kwa uangalifu.

287
00:15:02,012 --> 00:15:05,345
La, karibu.

288
00:15:05,368 --> 00:15:08,535
Tafadhali chukua muda wako.

289
00:15:08,558 --> 00:15:10,058
Sehemu ya 8: Ziara ya Kwanza Kwenye Gym: Salamu na Malengo

290
00:15:10,058 --> 00:15:11,466
Hujambo.

291
00:15:11,490 --> 00:15:14,890
Kuanzia leo nitakuwa na shukrani nyingi.

292
00:15:14,913 --> 00:15:16,279
Hujambo.

293
00:15:16,302 --> 00:15:18,918
Pia, asante kwa kunikaribisha.

294
00:15:18,942 --> 00:15:22,399
Je, leo ni mara yako ya kwanza kutumia gym?

295
00:15:22,423 --> 00:15:23,709
Ndiyo.

296
00:15:23,733 --> 00:15:25,982
Ndiyo, leo ni mara yangu ya kwanza.

297
00:15:26,006 --> 00:15:28,606
Asante kwa kujiunga nasi.

298
00:15:28,629 --> 00:15:32,162
Unataka kufikia nini kwa kutumia gym?

299
00:15:32,185 --> 00:15:36,385
Hivi majuzi, sikupata fursa ya kufanya mazoezi kwa sababu ya kazi.

300
00:15:36,408 --> 00:15:38,774
Ninataka kuongeza nguvu.

301
00:15:38,797 --> 00:15:41,331
Lengo zuri sana!

302
00:15:41,354 --> 00:15:43,570
Tutashirikiane kwa bidii.

303
00:15:43,593 --> 00:15:44,931
Ndiyo.

304
00:15:44,954 --> 00:15:46,788
Nakutakia kila la heri.

305
00:15:46,811 --> 00:15:51,499
Kwanza, nitaeleza jinsi ya kutumia mashine ya kukimbia.

306
00:15:51,522 --> 00:15:53,322
Tafadhali njoo hapa.

307
00:15:53,346 --> 00:15:55,631
Sawa, nimeelewa.

308
00:15:55,654 --> 00:16:00,504
Ukibonyeza kitufe hiki cha kijani, mashine itaanza kutembea.

309
00:16:00,528 --> 00:16:03,540
Unaweza kubadilisha kasi hapa.

310
00:16:03,563 --> 00:16:05,996
Ni kubonyeza kitufe, ndiyo?

311
00:16:06,019 --> 00:16:09,019
Kwanza tutakimbia polepole.

312
00:16:09,042 --> 00:16:10,409
Ndiyo.

313
00:16:10,432 --> 00:16:14,799
Anza kwa kutembea kwa dakika kumi na tano hivi.

314
00:16:14,822 --> 00:16:19,303
Kama unahisi unakosea nguvu, bonyeza kitufe cha nyekundu.

315
00:16:19,326 --> 00:16:21,092
Nimeelewa.

316
00:16:21,115 --> 00:16:23,715
Kitufe cha nyekundu kitaisimamisha, ndiyo?

317
00:16:23,738 --> 00:16:28,072
Kisha, nitakuelekeza kwenye mashine za mazoezi ya misuli.

318
00:16:28,095 --> 00:16:30,828
Hii ni mashine ya mazoezi ya miguu.

319
00:16:30,851 --> 00:16:33,651
Ninataka pia kuimarisha misuli ya miguu.

320
00:16:33,674 --> 00:16:36,485
Unaweza kubadilisha uzito hapa.

321
00:16:36,509 --> 00:16:40,042
Anza na uzito mdogo kwanza.

322
00:16:40,065 --> 00:16:41,742
Nimeelewa.

323
00:16:41,766 --> 00:16:44,332
Nitaweka uzito wa kilogramu tano.

324
00:16:44,355 --> 00:16:48,850
Usijiteme kwa nguvu, fanya mazoezi kwa mwendo wako mwenyewe.

325
00:16:48,874 --> 00:16:50,641
Asante.

326
00:16:50,664 --> 00:16:53,697
Nitapiga hatua kila siku.

327
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:57,994
Ukitoa jasho, hakikisha unywa maji ya kutosha.

328
00:16:58,018 --> 00:17:00,792
Kuna eneo la kunywa maji pale.

329
00:17:00,815 --> 00:17:02,782
Nimeelewa.

330
00:17:02,805 --> 00:17:05,384
Nitakunywa maji wakati wa mazoezi.

331
00:17:05,408 --> 00:17:09,741
Kama una swali lolote, uliza wafanyakazi wakati wowote.

332
00:17:09,764 --> 00:17:11,497
Asante.

333
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:13,819
Nimejisikia salama sana.

334
00:17:13,843 --> 00:17:17,282
Sasa, furahia mazoezi yako.

335
00:17:17,305 --> 00:17:18,515
Ndiyo.

336
00:17:18,539 --> 00:17:20,072
Nitabidi nijitahidi.

337
00:17:20,095 --> 00:17:21,595
Sehemu ya 9: Kukutana kwa mara ya kwanza na kujitambulisha

338
00:17:21,595 --> 00:17:26,362
Hujambo, mimi ni Yamada kutoka idara ya ubunifu.

339
00:17:26,385 --> 00:17:31,468
Hujambo, mimi ni Sato kutoka idara ya mauzo.

340
00:17:31,491 --> 00:17:34,364
Leo nitashukuru kwa msaada wako.

341
00:17:34,388 --> 00:17:37,835
Pia, asante kwa kunikaribisha.

342
00:17:37,858 --> 00:17:42,059
Sato, umefanya kazi hapa kwa muda gani?

343
00:17:42,083 --> 00:17:46,489
Nimeingia kampuni mwezi wa nne mwaka huu.

344
00:17:46,512 --> 00:17:50,388
Aha, ni mwajiriwa mpya basi.

345
00:17:50,411 --> 00:17:54,644
Ndiyo, bado ninajizoea.

346
00:17:54,667 --> 00:17:58,201
Mimi niko mwaka wa pili katika kampuni.

347
00:17:58,224 --> 00:18:02,042
Aha, wewe ni mwandamizi basi.

348
00:18:02,065 --> 00:18:05,080
La, bado nina mengi ya kujifunza.

349
00:18:05,104 --> 00:18:08,160
Kazi ya idara ya mauzo inakuwaje?

350
00:18:08,183 --> 00:18:13,017
Kazi ya idara ya mauzo ni ngumu kila siku.

351
00:18:13,041 --> 00:18:16,109
Lakini ni ya kufurahisha sana.

352
00:18:16,132 --> 00:18:18,573
Hiyo ni nzuri kusikia.

353
00:18:18,597 --> 00:18:21,797
Sasa unakunywa nini?

354
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:25,518
Sasa ninakunywa chai ya ulong.

355
00:18:25,541 --> 00:18:29,175
Mimi ninakunywa juisi ya machungwa baridi.

356
00:18:29,198 --> 00:18:33,431
Sato, unafanya nini wakati wa mapumziko?

357
00:18:33,454 --> 00:18:38,054
Mwishoni mwa wiki ninacheza mpira wa miguu.

358
00:18:38,077 --> 00:18:41,044
Ninafanya mazoezi na marafiki wangu bustanini.

359
00:18:41,067 --> 00:18:43,067
Na wewe Yamada?

360
00:18:43,090 --> 00:18:47,466
Mimi napenda kutazama filamu nyumbani.

361
00:18:47,489 --> 00:18:51,026
Ninapenda kutazama anime na filamu za Kijapani.

362
00:18:51,049 --> 00:18:53,947
Ninapenda anime pia.

363
00:18:53,970 --> 00:18:57,613
Tafadhali nipatie mapendekezo ya filamu unayopendelea.

364
00:18:57,637 --> 00:19:00,412
Ndiyo, kwa furaha.

365
00:19:00,435 --> 00:19:07,235
Kwa upande mwingine, idara ya mauzo na ubunifu mara nyingi hufanya kazi pamoja, sivyo?

366
00:19:07,258 --> 00:19:12,825
Ndiyo, nimesikia tutaunda brosha mpya pamoja.

367
00:19:12,848 --> 00:19:16,226
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana.

368
00:19:16,250 --> 00:19:20,117
Tafadhali nipee sauti tena ofisini.

369
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:22,340
Ndiyo, asante sana.

370
00:19:22,363 --> 00:19:25,199
Tutakubaliana vizuri kuanzia sasa.

371
00:19:25,222 --> 00:19:29,589
Ndiyo, mimi pia nitakubali.

372
00:19:29,611 --> 00:19:31,111
Mandhari ya 10: Kujulisha Kuhusu Mbwa na Matembezi Yao

373
00:19:31,111 --> 00:19:35,478
Hujambo. Mbwa yako ni mzuri sana!

374
00:19:35,501 --> 00:19:37,634
Hujambo. Asante sana.

375
00:19:37,657 --> 00:19:40,991
Mbwa wako ni wa aina gani?

376
00:19:41,014 --> 00:19:43,547
Ni Shiba Inu.

377
00:19:43,570 --> 00:19:46,629
Jina lake ni Hachi.

378
00:19:46,653 --> 00:19:48,886
Hachi, basi.

379
00:19:48,910 --> 00:19:50,983
Ana umri gani?

380
00:19:51,006 --> 00:19:53,240
Ana miaka miwili.

381
00:19:53,262 --> 00:19:56,722
Mbwa wako anaitwa nani?

382
00:19:56,746 --> 00:20:00,430
Mbwa wangu anaitwa Choko.

383
00:20:00,453 --> 00:20:02,686
Ni Toy Poodle.

384
00:20:02,709 --> 00:20:05,276
Choko, basi.

385
00:20:05,299 --> 00:20:07,133
Ana umri gani?

386
00:20:07,157 --> 00:20:09,723
Ana miaka mitatu.

387
00:20:09,746 --> 00:20:13,379
Kila siku huwa mnatembea wakati huu?

388
00:20:13,402 --> 00:20:14,869
Ndiyo.

389
00:20:14,892 --> 00:20:18,459
Kila asubuhi saa moja hivi huja hapa.

390
00:20:18,482 --> 00:20:22,750
Mimi pia natembea saa moja kila asubuhi.

391
00:20:22,773 --> 00:20:26,906
Kwa hiyo tutaonana mara kwa mara sasa, labda.

392
00:20:26,929 --> 00:20:28,899
Ndiyo!

393
00:20:28,923 --> 00:20:34,956
Samahani, unajua hospitali ya wanyama inayopendekezwa karibu na hapa?

394
00:20:34,979 --> 00:20:36,413
Ndiyo.

395
00:20:36,436 --> 00:20:41,085
Kuna Sakurah Animal Hospital karibu na kituo cha gari la moshi.

396
00:20:41,109 --> 00:20:44,542
Daktari ni mtu mzuri sana.

397
00:20:44,565 --> 00:20:46,440
Ndiyo hivyo.

398
00:20:46,464 --> 00:20:49,530
Asante kwa kunifundisha.

399
00:20:49,553 --> 00:20:53,242
La, karibu.

400
00:20:53,266 --> 00:20:56,833
Kuna uwanja wa mbwa pia karibu na hapa.

401
00:20:56,856 --> 00:21:00,389
Haya, iko wapi?

402
00:21:00,412 --> 00:21:02,249
Ningependa kwenda kuutazama.

403
00:21:02,273 --> 00:21:06,506
Iko karibu na ingilio la upande wa mashariki wa bustani.

404
00:21:06,529 --> 00:21:09,296
Kuna nyasi pana.

405
00:21:09,319 --> 00:21:11,519
Ndiyo, basi.

406
00:21:11,542 --> 00:21:13,956
Nitakwenda siku hizi.

407
00:21:13,979 --> 00:21:17,412
Ee, tafadhali nenda uutazame.

408
00:21:17,435 --> 00:21:20,969
Sasa, nitakuwa nikiondoka.

409
00:21:20,991 --> 00:21:22,604
Ndiyo.

410
00:21:22,628 --> 00:21:25,161
Asante kwa leo.

411
00:21:25,184 --> 00:21:28,866
Hapana. Tutaonana tena.

412
00:21:28,890 --> 00:21:30,290
Ndiyo.

413
00:21:30,313 --> 00:21:32,980
Tutakubaliana tena.

414
00:21:33,003 --> 00:21:34,503
Mandhari ya 11: Jinsi ya Kuangalia Viti na Mazungumzo Mafupi

415
00:21:34,503 --> 00:21:36,346
Samahani.

416
00:21:36,369 --> 00:21:39,614
Kiti hiki kina watu?

417
00:21:39,638 --> 00:21:42,471
Hapana, kina watu wala.

418
00:21:42,494 --> 00:21:44,774
Tafadhali keti.

419
00:21:44,798 --> 00:21:46,446
Asante.

420
00:21:46,469 --> 00:21:49,636
Nitaketi hapa.

421
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:52,226
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri, sivyo?

422
00:21:52,249 --> 00:21:54,907
Je, huja hapa mara kwa mara?

423
00:21:54,931 --> 00:21:58,735
Hapana, ni mara yangu ya kwanza.

424
00:21:58,759 --> 00:22:01,815
Pahali hapa ni pazuri sana, sivyo?

425
00:22:01,838 --> 00:22:03,471
Ndiyo, kweli.

426
00:22:03,494 --> 00:22:07,028
Ni kimya na rahisi kufanya kazi hapa.

427
00:22:07,051 --> 00:22:10,884
Nywila ya Wi-Fi iko wapi?

428
00:22:10,907 --> 00:22:14,840
Tazama kadi juu ya meza ile.

429
00:22:14,863 --> 00:22:17,335
Imeandikwa hapo.

430
00:22:17,359 --> 00:22:19,759
Aa, kweli ndivyo.

431
00:22:19,782 --> 00:22:21,382
Asante.

432
00:22:21,405 --> 00:22:24,971
Kuna vinywaji bure?

433
00:22:24,994 --> 00:22:28,127
Ndiyo, vipo huko.

434
00:22:28,150 --> 00:22:30,609
Kuna kahawa na chai.

435
00:22:30,633 --> 00:22:33,072
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

436
00:22:33,096 --> 00:22:36,576
Nitakwenda kuchukua kinywaji baadaye.

437
00:22:36,599 --> 00:22:40,332
Wewe hufanya kazi gani?

438
00:22:40,355 --> 00:22:43,322
Mimi ni mwandishi wa habari za mtandao.

439
00:22:43,345 --> 00:22:46,011
Ninaandika makala kwa kutumia kompyuta.

440
00:22:46,034 --> 00:22:48,168
Ndiyo hivyo.

441
00:22:48,191 --> 00:22:51,391
Mimi ni mtaalamu wa programu.

442
00:22:51,414 --> 00:22:53,309
Hii ni nzuri sana!

443
00:22:53,332 --> 00:22:56,599
Kazi ya programu ni ngumu?

444
00:22:56,622 --> 00:23:01,227
Mara kwa mara ni ngumu, lakini ni ya furaha.

445
00:23:01,250 --> 00:23:03,133
Ndiyo hivyo.

446
00:23:03,157 --> 00:23:05,893
Tuwe na bidii katika kazi zetu.

447
00:23:05,916 --> 00:23:08,890
Ndiyo, tuwe na bidii.

448
00:23:08,914 --> 00:23:12,680
Sasa nitaanza kazi yangu.

449
00:23:12,703 --> 00:23:15,740
Sawa, karibu ukafanye kazi yako.

450
00:23:15,764 --> 00:23:17,264
Mlo 12: Mazungumzo ya Kwanza / First Meeting Conversations

451
00:23:17,264 --> 00:23:19,304
Hujambo.

452
00:23:19,327 --> 00:23:21,894
Naweza kuketi hapa?

453
00:23:21,917 --> 00:23:23,894
Hujambo.

454
00:23:23,918 --> 00:23:26,355
Ndiyo, karibu.

455
00:23:26,378 --> 00:23:28,145
Asante.

456
00:23:28,168 --> 00:23:30,568
Jina langu ni Anna.

457
00:23:30,591 --> 00:23:32,462
Nakutakia kila la heri.

458
00:23:32,485 --> 00:23:34,885
Mimi ni Ken.

459
00:23:34,908 --> 00:23:38,242
Mimi pia, naomba utujalie.

460
00:23:38,265 --> 00:23:41,401
Ken, umetoka wapi?

461
00:23:41,424 --> 00:23:44,090
Nimetoka Australia.

462
00:23:44,114 --> 00:23:46,683
Lugha yangu ya kwanza ni Kiingereza.

463
00:23:46,706 --> 00:23:48,306
Ndiyo hivyo.

464
00:23:48,329 --> 00:23:51,421
Mimi nimetoka Hispania.

465
00:23:51,444 --> 00:23:53,857
Lugha yangu ya kwanza ni Kihispania.

466
00:23:53,881 --> 00:23:57,769
Sasa ninapata mazoezi ya Kijapani.

467
00:23:57,792 --> 00:24:00,959
Mimi pia ninataka kujifunza Kijapani.

468
00:24:00,982 --> 00:24:04,155
Tuongee kwa Kijapani pamoja!

469
00:24:04,179 --> 00:24:06,245
Ndiyo, asante sana.

470
00:24:06,269 --> 00:24:10,436
Anna, kwa nini ulija Japani?

471
00:24:10,459 --> 00:24:14,193
Ninapenda anime na chakula cha Japani.

472
00:24:14,216 --> 00:24:16,696
Unapenda anime gani?

473
00:24:16,719 --> 00:24:19,521
Napenda anime za filamu.

474
00:24:19,544 --> 00:24:23,121
Ken, je, unapenda chakula cha Japani?

475
00:24:23,145 --> 00:24:27,321
Ndiyo, napenda ramen na sushi sana.

476
00:24:27,344 --> 00:24:31,978
Australia kuna chakula kitamu?

477
00:24:32,001 --> 00:24:37,139
Ndiyo, kuna bahari nzuri na chakula cha nyama kitamu.

478
00:24:37,162 --> 00:24:38,839
Sawa, ni vizuri.

479
00:24:38,862 --> 00:24:42,158
Siku moja ningependa kwenda Australia.

480
00:24:42,182 --> 00:24:44,276
Karibu sana uje.

481
00:24:44,299 --> 00:24:48,183
…Anna, Kijapani chako ni kizuri sana.

482
00:24:48,207 --> 00:24:49,782
Asante.

483
00:24:49,805 --> 00:24:53,238
Lakini, nataka kujifunza zaidi.

484
00:24:53,261 --> 00:24:57,338
Leo nimefurahi sana kuongea kwa Kijapani.

485
00:24:57,361 --> 00:24:59,495
Tutane hapa tena.

486
00:24:59,518 --> 00:25:02,384
Ndiyo, tutaonana tena!

487
00:25:02,407 --> 00:25:04,607
Asante sana.

488
00:25:04,630 --> 00:25:06,130
Mchezo 13: Darasa la Kwanza la Kupika

489
00:25:06,130 --> 00:25:10,497
Hujambo, naomba uwe na siku njema leo.

490
00:25:10,520 --> 00:25:13,920
Hujambo, naomba uwe na siku njema.

491
00:25:13,943 --> 00:25:16,743
Jina langu ni Kim.

492
00:25:16,766 --> 00:25:19,299
Mimi ni Tanaka.

493
00:25:19,323 --> 00:25:22,925
Dawati hili la kupikia lina nafasi kubwa sana, sivyo?

494
00:25:22,949 --> 00:25:24,767
Ndiyo, kweli.

495
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:27,723
Linatumika vizuri sana.

496
00:25:27,746 --> 00:25:31,791
Je, ni mara yako ya kwanza kuhudhuria darasa la kupikia, Bibi Kimu?

497
00:25:31,815 --> 00:25:35,348
Ndiyo, leo ndiyo mara yangu ya kwanza.

498
00:25:35,371 --> 00:25:37,850
Nina wasiwasi kidogo.

499
00:25:37,874 --> 00:25:40,212
Usijali, hakuna matata.

500
00:25:40,236 --> 00:25:42,869
Mwalimu ni mzuri sana.

501
00:25:42,892 --> 00:25:46,425
Je, Bwana Tanaka, wewe huja mara kwa mara?

502
00:25:46,448 --> 00:25:50,415
Hapana, mimi pia nilianza mwezi uliopita.

503
00:25:50,438 --> 00:25:54,638
Kwa nini ulikuja darasani kwa kupikia, Bibi Kimu?

504
00:25:54,661 --> 00:25:59,299
Mwezi uliopita nilianza kuishi peke yangu.

505
00:25:59,323 --> 00:26:03,094
Nataka kujifunza kupika vyakula vizuri.

506
00:26:03,117 --> 00:26:05,250
Ni nzuri sana!

507
00:26:05,273 --> 00:26:08,507
Je, huwa unapika nyumbani mara kwa mara?

508
00:26:08,530 --> 00:26:11,896
Hapana, sijapika sana bado.

509
00:26:11,919 --> 00:26:15,355
Ninaweza kupika supu rahisi tu.

510
00:26:15,379 --> 00:26:17,237
Ndiyo hivyo.

511
00:26:17,260 --> 00:26:21,100
Leo tutapika nyama na viazi, sivyo?

512
00:26:21,124 --> 00:26:24,790
Ndiyo, ni chakula cha kawaida cha Kijapani.

513
00:26:24,813 --> 00:26:27,180
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

514
00:26:27,203 --> 00:26:30,736
Tutatumia viazi na nyama ya ng'ombe.

515
00:26:30,759 --> 00:26:32,132
Ndiyo.

516
00:26:32,156 --> 00:26:36,794
Aa, mwalimu karibu anafika.

517
00:26:36,817 --> 00:26:40,632
Wavaliwe mavazi ya kupikia na nawa mikono vizuri.

518
00:26:40,655 --> 00:26:42,889
Ndiyo, ni vizuri.

519
00:26:42,912 --> 00:26:45,354
Tutashirikiane kwa bidii.

520
00:26:45,377 --> 00:26:48,348
Ndiyo, tuwe na bidii.

521
00:26:48,371 --> 00:26:49,871
Mchezo 14: Siku ya Kwanza ya Kujitolea

522
00:26:49,871 --> 00:26:54,871
Hujambo, leo nitashiriki katika shughuli za kujitolea.

523
00:26:54,894 --> 00:26:57,028
Mimi ni Tanaka.

524
00:26:57,051 --> 00:27:01,388
Hujambo, mimi ni Sato, mmoja wa wajitolea.

525
00:27:01,412 --> 00:27:03,812
Nakutakia kila la heri.

526
00:27:03,835 --> 00:27:06,036
Nakutakia kila la heri.

527
00:27:06,060 --> 00:27:11,342
Leo ni siku yangu ya kwanza, kwa hivyo nina wasiwasi kidogo.

528
00:27:11,366 --> 00:27:13,999
Usijali, hakuna matata.

529
00:27:14,022 --> 00:27:18,555
Kila mtu atakuelekeza kwa upendo, usijali.

530
00:27:18,578 --> 00:27:20,312
Asante.

531
00:27:20,335 --> 00:27:25,335
Kwa nini uliamua kushiriki katika shughuli hizi za kujitolea, Bwana Tanaka?

532
00:27:25,357 --> 00:27:30,692
Mwezi uliopita nilihamia mjini hapa.

533
00:27:30,716 --> 00:27:36,916
Nilitaka kushiriki katika shughuli za jamii na kupata marafiki.

534
00:27:36,939 --> 00:27:39,415
Ni nzuri sana!

535
00:27:39,438 --> 00:27:45,405
Huu mbuga, watu wa jirani huja kutembea hapa mara kwa mara.

536
00:27:45,428 --> 00:27:48,661
Mbuga hii ni nzuri sana.

537
00:27:48,684 --> 00:27:50,617
Ndiyo.

538
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:56,807
Lakini baada ya mwisho wa wiki, kuna takataka na majani mengi yanayotapakaa.

539
00:27:56,830 --> 00:28:00,597
Tafadhali niambie kazi za leo.

540
00:28:00,620 --> 00:28:05,886
Leo kwanza tutakusanya takataka zilizomo ndani ya mbuga.

541
00:28:05,909 --> 00:28:10,946
Baadaye tutakusanya majani yaliyotapakaa karibu na benchi.

542
00:28:10,970 --> 00:28:12,703
Nimeelewa.

543
00:28:12,726 --> 00:28:15,770
Vifaa vipo wapi?

544
00:28:15,794 --> 00:28:19,286
Vipo ndani ya sanduku la buluu lililo huko.

545
00:28:19,310 --> 00:28:23,643
Tumia glavu, tongs na mifuko ya takataka.

546
00:28:23,666 --> 00:28:25,266
Asante.

547
00:28:25,289 --> 00:28:29,022
Je, tunatenganisha takataka?

548
00:28:29,045 --> 00:28:30,522
Ndiyo.

549
00:28:30,546 --> 00:28:35,352
Tutatenganisha takataka inayowaka na makopo, na chupa za plastiki.

550
00:28:35,375 --> 00:28:37,041
Nimeelewa.

551
00:28:37,064 --> 00:28:38,998
Nitakuwa makini.

552
00:28:39,021 --> 00:28:43,103
Kazi itaisha baada ya saa moja hivi.

553
00:28:43,127 --> 00:28:46,966
Baada ya kumaliza, tutaonana kwa chai.

554
00:28:46,989 --> 00:28:49,479
Ninangojea kwa hamu.

555
00:28:49,502 --> 00:28:52,599
Leo nitajitahidi kwa bidii sana.

556
00:28:52,622 --> 00:28:55,316
Tutashirikiane kwa bidii.

557
00:28:55,340 --> 00:28:56,840
Mstari wa 15: Mlango wa Klabu ya Picha / Utangulizi wa Klabu ya Upigaji Picha

558
00:28:56,840 --> 00:29:01,208
Hujambo. Karibu sana kwenye Klabu ya Upigaji Picha.

559
00:29:01,231 --> 00:29:02,731
Mstari wa 16: Mazungumzo kwenye Treni / Mazungumzo kwenye Gari la Moshi

560
00:29:02,731 --> 00:29:04,531
Samahani.

561
00:29:04,554 --> 00:29:07,954
Hii ni kiti cha 10B?

562
00:29:07,977 --> 00:29:12,156
Ndiyo, ni kiti karibu na changu.

563
00:29:12,180 --> 00:29:14,180
Asante.

564
00:29:14,203 --> 00:29:18,442
Nitaweka mizigo yangu kwenye rafu ya juu.

565
00:29:18,465 --> 00:29:20,299
Naomba nikusaidie?

566
00:29:20,322 --> 00:29:22,888
Mzigo wako una uzito?

567
00:29:22,911 --> 00:29:25,511
Hapana, niko sawa.

568
00:29:25,534 --> 00:29:28,143
Asante kwa kujali.

569
00:29:28,167 --> 00:29:31,746
Leo hii hali ya hewa ni nzuri, sivyo?

570
00:29:31,769 --> 00:29:34,206
Unaenda wapi?

571
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:37,104
Mimi ninaenda Kyoto.

572
00:29:37,127 --> 00:29:40,294
Wewe unaenda wapi?

573
00:29:40,317 --> 00:29:44,050
Mimi ninaenda Shin-Osaka.

574
00:29:44,073 --> 00:29:45,507
Unaenda kwa safari?

575
00:29:45,530 --> 00:29:47,808
Au kwa kazi?

576
00:29:47,831 --> 00:29:50,064
Ninakuwa kwa safari.

577
00:29:50,087 --> 00:29:52,929
Nitakutana na rafiki yangu Kyoto.

578
00:29:52,952 --> 00:29:54,486
Sawa, ni vizuri.

579
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:58,077
Mimi ninaenda kwa kazi ya ofisi.

580
00:29:58,100 --> 00:30:00,233
Kazi?

581
00:30:00,256 --> 00:30:02,123
Inakuwa ngumu, sivyo?

582
00:30:02,146 --> 00:30:05,316
Unaenda Kyoto mara kwa mara?

583
00:30:05,339 --> 00:30:08,173
Hapana, ni mara ya kwanza baada ya muda mrefu.

584
00:30:08,196 --> 00:30:12,529
Kyoto kuna chakula kitamu sana.

585
00:30:12,552 --> 00:30:16,847
Hasa aiskrimu ya matcha ni maarufu sana.

586
00:30:16,870 --> 00:30:21,044
Kuna duka la kitamu karibu na kituo cha treni.

587
00:30:21,068 --> 00:30:23,406
Aiskrimu ya matcha?

588
00:30:23,429 --> 00:30:25,996
Ningependa kuitafuna sana.

589
00:30:26,019 --> 00:30:29,786
Aa, tutafika Kyoto hivi punde.

590
00:30:29,809 --> 00:30:33,079
Asante kwa kunipa maelezo mengi.

591
00:30:33,102 --> 00:30:36,201
La, karibu.

592
00:30:36,225 --> 00:30:38,916
Natumai utafurahia safari yako.

593
00:30:38,939 --> 00:30:41,673
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana.

594
00:30:41,696 --> 00:30:44,555
Uwe na bidii katika kazi yako.

595
00:30:44,578 --> 00:30:46,453
Samahani.

596
00:30:46,477 --> 00:30:47,974
Asante.

597
00:30:47,997 --> 00:30:50,874
Safari njema.

598
00:30:50,897 --> 00:30:52,397
Mstari wa 17: Mazungumzo ya Kwanza / Salamu na Asili

599
00:30:52,397 --> 00:30:54,531
Habari za jioni.

600
00:30:54,553 --> 00:30:57,443
Naweza kukaa hapa?

601
00:30:57,467 --> 00:30:59,355
Habari za jioni.

602
00:30:59,378 --> 00:31:01,578
Ndiyo, karibu.

603
00:31:01,601 --> 00:31:03,482
Asante.

604
00:31:03,506 --> 00:31:06,752
Lounge hii ni nzuri sana.

605
00:31:06,776 --> 00:31:08,514
Ndiyo, kweli.

606
00:31:08,537 --> 00:31:12,216
Ni kimya na inafaa kwa kupumzika.

607
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:15,527
Wewe umetoka wapi?

608
00:31:15,550 --> 00:31:18,801
Mimi nimetoka Marekani.

609
00:31:18,824 --> 00:31:22,102
Wewe umetoka wapi?

610
00:31:22,126 --> 00:31:25,175
Mimi nimetoka Thailand.

611
00:31:25,199 --> 00:31:28,599
Umefika lini Japani?

612
00:31:28,622 --> 00:31:31,793
Nilifika jana usiku.

613
00:31:31,816 --> 00:31:34,673
Nitakaa hapa kwa siku tatu.

614
00:31:34,696 --> 00:31:36,496
Ndiyo hivyo.

615
00:31:36,519 --> 00:31:40,919
Mimi nitakaa kwa siku nne kuanzia leo.

616
00:31:40,942 --> 00:31:43,875
Leo umekwenda wapi?

617
00:31:43,898 --> 00:31:47,898
Leo nilienda hekalu karibu hapa.

618
00:31:47,921 --> 00:31:52,455
Nilitembelea hekalu la kale lililokuwa la kupendeza sana.

619
00:31:52,478 --> 00:31:54,344
Sawa, ni vizuri.

620
00:31:54,367 --> 00:31:58,637
Nilikwenda kununua vitu karibu na kituo cha treni.

621
00:31:58,661 --> 00:32:02,095
Kesho utakwenda wapi?

622
00:32:02,118 --> 00:32:06,962
Kesho nitakwenda kutembelea ngome mashuhuri asubuhi.

623
00:32:06,985 --> 00:32:09,392
Wewe utakwenda wapi?

624
00:32:09,415 --> 00:32:14,828
Kesho nitakwenda bustani kubwa na jumba la makumbusho.

625
00:32:14,852 --> 00:32:19,818
Karibu na jumba la makumbusho kuna mgahawa mzuri wa ramen.

626
00:32:19,842 --> 00:32:21,775
Kweli?

627
00:32:21,798 --> 00:32:24,998
Mimi pia napenda ramen.

628
00:32:25,021 --> 00:32:27,233
Ningependa kwenda kuutazama.

629
00:32:27,257 --> 00:32:32,031
Aa, kule kuna chai moto.

630
00:32:32,054 --> 00:32:34,787
Unaweza kunywa bure.

631
00:32:34,810 --> 00:32:37,418
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

632
00:32:37,442 --> 00:32:40,017
Nikupikie chai?

633
00:32:40,041 --> 00:32:41,641
Asante.

634
00:32:41,664 --> 00:32:43,198
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

635
00:32:43,221 --> 00:32:45,587
Umechelewa.

636
00:32:45,610 --> 00:32:48,178
Hii ni chai ya kijani moto.

637
00:32:48,202 --> 00:32:50,018
Asante.

638
00:32:50,041 --> 00:32:52,850
Chai hii ni tamu sana.

639
00:32:52,873 --> 00:32:57,325
Tukunywe chai na tuzungumze kuhusu mpango wa safari yetu.

640
00:32:57,349 --> 00:33:00,118
Ndiyo, fanya hivyo.

641
00:33:00,141 --> 00:33:01,641
Sehemu ya 18: Safari ya Kwanza ya Kupanda Mlima

642
00:33:01,641 --> 00:33:03,721
Habari za asubuhi.

643
00:33:03,744 --> 00:33:05,811
Hujambo.

644
00:33:05,834 --> 00:33:07,838
Habari za asubuhi.

645
00:33:07,861 --> 00:33:09,676
Hujambo.

646
00:33:09,699 --> 00:33:11,784
Mimi ni Tanaka.

647
00:33:11,807 --> 00:33:14,691
Mimi ni Yamada, kiongozi wa klabu ya kupanda milima.

648
00:33:14,714 --> 00:33:17,548
Leo nitashukuru kwa msaada wako.

649
00:33:17,571 --> 00:33:21,371
Mimi pia, naomba utujalie.

650
00:33:21,394 --> 00:33:24,997
Karibu katika klabu yetu ya kupanda milima.

651
00:33:25,020 --> 00:33:29,278
Bwana Tanaka, umewahi kupanda milima?

652
00:33:29,302 --> 00:33:32,760
Hapana, sijawahi sana.

653
00:33:32,783 --> 00:33:36,383
Hii ni mara yangu ya kwanza kupanda mlima mrefu.

654
00:33:36,406 --> 00:33:38,839
Nimeelewa.

655
00:33:38,862 --> 00:33:42,343
Mlima wa leo ni mrefu kidogo tu.

656
00:33:42,367 --> 00:33:46,500
Njia ni rahisi kutembea, usijali.

657
00:33:46,523 --> 00:33:48,656
Vizuri sana.

658
00:33:48,679 --> 00:33:50,879
Nimejifunza kidogo.

659
00:33:50,902 --> 00:33:55,036
Tukagundue vifaa kabla ya kuondoka.

660
00:33:55,059 --> 00:33:58,325
Nionyeshe viatu unavyovaa.

661
00:33:58,348 --> 00:34:01,395
Haya, hivi ndivyo viatu vyangu.

662
00:34:01,418 --> 00:34:04,785
Nimevaa viatu vya michezo vinavyodumu.

663
00:34:04,808 --> 00:34:06,987
Viatu vizuri sana.

664
00:34:07,011 --> 00:34:10,144
Hivi havitatiririka.

665
00:34:10,167 --> 00:34:14,181
Kisha, una vitu vya mvua?

666
00:34:14,205 --> 00:34:18,039
Ndiyo, nimeweka kaptura ya mvua kwenye begi langu.

667
00:34:18,062 --> 00:34:20,229
Ni nzuri sana!

668
00:34:20,252 --> 00:34:24,907
Hali ya hewa milimani hubadilika kwa haraka, ni muhimu.

669
00:34:24,930 --> 00:34:28,597
Je, una maji au chai ya kutosha?

670
00:34:28,620 --> 00:34:33,620
Ndiyo, nina chupa mbili za maji zenye nusu lita.

671
00:34:33,643 --> 00:34:35,919
Zinatosha.

672
00:34:35,942 --> 00:34:39,362
Je, una chakula cha mchana?

673
00:34:39,385 --> 00:34:43,962
Ndiyo, nilinunua onigiri katika duka la karibu na njia.

674
00:34:43,985 --> 00:34:47,385
Umejiandaa vizuri.

675
00:34:47,408 --> 00:34:51,842
Kwa njia ya leo, tutachukua saa mbili kupanda.

676
00:34:51,865 --> 00:34:55,243
Tupumzike polepole wakati wa kupanda.

677
00:34:55,266 --> 00:34:59,278
Ikiwa utakomaa njiani, waseme mara moja.

678
00:34:59,302 --> 00:35:01,435
Ndiyo, asante sana.

679
00:35:01,458 --> 00:35:04,896
Nitapiga nguvu ili nisije nikasababisha matatizo.

680
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:07,387
Usijali, hakuna matata.

681
00:35:07,410 --> 00:35:09,743
Tusaidiane kama kundi.

682
00:35:09,766 --> 00:35:13,299
Leo tutafanya kila kitu kwa usalama wa kwanza.

683
00:35:13,322 --> 00:35:15,941
Basi, twende sasa!

684
00:35:15,965 --> 00:35:19,331
Ndiyo, naomba msaada wako!

685
00:35:19,354 --> 00:35:20,854
Sehemu ya 19: Hatua za Kwanza katika Ufinyanzi

686
00:35:20,854 --> 00:35:27,588
Habari yako, karibu katika darasa la ufinyanzi! Mimi ni mwalimu Yamada.

687
00:35:27,611 --> 00:35:31,046
Habari yako, ninaitwa Tanaka.

688
00:35:31,069 --> 00:35:33,742
Leo nitashukuru kwa msaada wako.

689
00:35:33,766 --> 00:35:36,299
Nakutakia kila la heri.

690
00:35:36,322 --> 00:35:40,922
Bwana Tanaka, je, umewahi kufanya ufinyanzi hapana?

691
00:35:40,945 --> 00:35:43,813
Hapana, mara yangu ya kwanza.

692
00:35:43,837 --> 00:35:46,804
Nilikuwa ninataka kujaribu kwa muda mrefu.

693
00:35:46,827 --> 00:35:50,060
Vipi, nafurahi kusikia hiyo.

694
00:35:50,083 --> 00:35:54,083
Leo unataka kutengeneza kitu gani?

695
00:35:54,106 --> 00:35:58,473
Ningependa kutengeneza bakuli la chai ambalo naweza kutumia kila siku.

696
00:35:58,495 --> 00:36:01,311
Ningependa iwe kubwa kidogo.

697
00:36:01,334 --> 00:36:03,101
Sawa, ni vizuri.

698
00:36:03,124 --> 00:36:06,290
Tutengeneze bakuli la chai zuri.

699
00:36:06,313 --> 00:36:10,080
Kwanza, nawa mikono yako vizuri.

700
00:36:10,103 --> 00:36:12,921
Nimekwisha nawa.

701
00:36:12,944 --> 00:36:16,611
Sasa, tutatumia udongo huu.

702
00:36:16,634 --> 00:36:20,602
Kwanza, umba udongo huu kwa umbo la mviringo.

703
00:36:20,626 --> 00:36:22,519
Nimeelewa.

704
00:36:22,542 --> 00:36:25,542
Nitaifanya iwe mviringo kwa mikono yangu.

705
00:36:25,565 --> 00:36:27,654
Unafanya vizuri!

706
00:36:27,678 --> 00:36:32,445
Kisha, weka hii kwenye gurudumu.

707
00:36:32,467 --> 00:36:37,909
Weka maji kwa mikono yako kisha uanze kuzungusha gurudumu kwa kubofya pedali.

708
00:36:37,933 --> 00:36:39,700
Nimeelewa.

709
00:36:39,723 --> 00:36:41,889
Nimeweka maji.

710
00:36:41,912 --> 00:36:45,746
Sasa, fanya shimo katikati kwa kidole gumba.

711
00:36:45,769 --> 00:36:49,303
Sawa, nitajaribu kufanya polepole.

712
00:36:49,326 --> 00:36:52,493
Aa, shimo limefanyika!

713
00:36:52,516 --> 00:36:54,533
Umefanya vizuri!

714
00:36:54,556 --> 00:36:59,323
Tega kwa mikono yako miwili na uinue polepole.

715
00:36:59,346 --> 00:37:02,622
Sawa, nitainua polepole.

716
00:37:02,646 --> 00:37:06,525
Inazidi kuwa umbo la bakuli la chai.

717
00:37:06,548 --> 00:37:09,481
Umepata umbo zuri sana!

718
00:37:09,504 --> 00:37:14,560
Fanya sehemu ya chini iwe tambarare... na hii ndiyo imekamilika!

719
00:37:14,583 --> 00:37:18,425
Inachukua muda gani hadi itakapopikwa?

720
00:37:18,449 --> 00:37:21,548
Inachukua takriban mwezi mmoja.

721
00:37:21,571 --> 00:37:25,838
Itapelekwa nyumbani kwako itakapokamilika.

722
00:37:25,861 --> 00:37:28,066
Nitasubiri kwa hamu.

723
00:37:28,089 --> 00:37:32,538
Leo umenifundisha kwa uangalifu, asante sana.

724
00:37:32,561 --> 00:37:36,295
Hapana, asante wewe.

725
00:37:36,317 --> 00:37:39,613
Karibu uje tena wakati wowote.

726
00:37:39,637 --> 00:37:42,331
Ndiyo, nitakuja tena!